<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Banco de Galicia started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banco de Galicia started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan Securities said on Tuesday it started coverage of Banco de Galicia y Buenos Aires SA's American Depositary Receipt as a market performer.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We believe Banco de Galicia will benefit from the economic recovery we foresee for Argentina over the next year,&quot; analyst Brian Pearl wrote in an report.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Galicia has a strong platform from which it can continue to gain loan and deposit market share.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
